,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTkxNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/891914?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov","html_url":"https://github.com/spolitov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2024-11-07T02:32:30Z","updated_at":"2024-11-21T16:24:57Z","closed_at":"2024-11-21T16:24:57Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-13928](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-13928)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\n**Description**\r\nVersion: 2.25.0.0-b91\r\nSteps:\r\n1. Create database and Create table with rows >= 100000\r\n2. Make table with primary keys ASC\r\n3. Load data\r\n4. Do select query with order by id DESC\r\n\r\nObserved Error:\r\n`ERROR:  Key 072CDC47C0006B40BF9736686584C894C621 is not table tombstone key.`\r\n\r\nSteps:\r\nCreate required table with load data\r\n```\r\nCREATE TABLE customer_accounts (\r\n    account_id bigint,\r\n    customer_id bigint,\r\n    account_balance bigint,\r\n    account_number bigint,\r\n    account_type varchar(20),\r\n    currency varchar(5),\r\n    status varchar(10),\r\n    country varchar(20),\r\n    created_at bigint,\r\n    updated_at bigint,\r\n    PRIMARY KEY(customer_id ASC, account_id ASC)\r\n);\r\nINSERT INTO customer_accounts (account_id, customer_id, account_balance, account_number, \r\n                               account_type, currency, status, country, created_at, updated_at)\r\nSELECT \r\n    i,                            \r\n    i,                       \r\n    i * 1000,                     \r\n    i * 100000::bigint,           \r\n    CASE WHEN i % 2 = 0 THEN 'Savings' ELSE 'Checking' END,  \r\n    CASE WHEN i % 3 = 0 THEN 'USD' ELSE 'EUR' END,  \r\n    CASE WHEN i % 5 = 0 THEN 'Active' ELSE 'Inactive' END,  \r\n    'Country_' || (i % 10),       \r\n    i * 10000::bigint,            \r\n    (i * 10000 + 1000)::bigint    \r\nFROM generate_series(1, 100000) AS i;  \r\n```\r\nQuery giving error:\r\n```\r\nEXPLAIN ANALYZE SELECT account_id FROM customer_accounts\r\nWHERE account_id > 1 ORDER BY customer_id DESC;\r\n```\r\nQuery that passes:\r\n```\r\nEXPLAIN ANALYZE SELECT account_id FROM customer_accounts\r\nWHERE account_id > 1 ORDER BY customer_id DESC LIMIT 10000;\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Other observations**\r\nInitially was facing this while testing fast backward scan, but then observed the same error with fast_backward_scan turned off. After talking with @arybochkin he could reproduce same issue on the commit before the fast_backward_scan commit. This means that this error is unrelated to fast backward scan.\r\n\r\nAlso do not get same error with 99999 rows but get with 100000 rows.\r\nAlso do not get error when I LIMIT the select query.\r\nDetails with queries on JIRA.\r\n\r\n### Issue Type\r\n\r\nkind/bug\r\n\r\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\r\n\r\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\r\n\r\n[DB-13928]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-13928?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"rthallamko3","id":17170123,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTcwMTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17170123?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3","html_url":"https://github.com/rthallamko3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/24824/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/24824/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}